  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Full Walking single-factor command-signal experiment: each backend/native-PPO combination compares the official low-speed tracking term against a bounded boost for nonzero linear commands below 0.2 m/s. The official task factory, command ranges, PPO semantics, 8192 environments and 50000-update budget remain unchanged. This is a causal hypothesis, not an accepted replacement recipe.",
